  "step4Title": "Duba Fahimtar Ku",
  "step4Description": "Shafin gida yana nuna fahimtar haihuwa na yau da kullum bisa bayanan ku. Duba kwanakin haihuwa, hasashen fitarwar kwai, da taƙaitaccen zagayowar.",
