  "step6Description": "Ziyarci shafin Support don ƙarfafawa da tushen bangaskiya da kayayyaki. Zaɓi zaɓin bangaskiya a cikin saiti don abun ciki na musamman.",
  "step7Title": "Duba Hasashe",
  "step7Description": "Kalandar ku yana alamta kwanakin al'ada na gaba da aka hasashe da da'irori masu launi ja. Al'adu da suka gabata suna bayyana a matsayin da'irori ja cike.",
